{"ticker":"PNR","updated":"2026-10-30T23:06:30Z","profile":{"longName":"Pentair plc","shortName":"Pentair plc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"United Kingdom","website":"https://www.pentair.com","fullTimeEmployees":9000,"marketCap":10578719744,"trailingPE":18.054497,"forwardPE":12.496393,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.667218,"pegRatio":0.93,"targetMeanPrice":73.6,"targetHighPrice":94.0,"targetLowPrice":55.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.045,"earningsGrowth":-0.188,"grossMargins":0.40168998,"operatingMargins":0.21897,"profitMargins":0.15435,"totalRevenue":3966200064,"beta":1.031,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":109.89,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":51.13,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.64},"summary":"Pentair plc provides various water solutions in the United States, Western Europe, China, Latin America, the Middle East, Southeast Asia, Australia, and Canada. It operates through three segments: Flow, Water Solutions, and Pool. The Flow segment designs, manufactures, and sells fluid treatment and pump products and systems, including pressure vessels, gas recovery solutions, membrane bioreactors, wastewater reuse systems and advanced membrane filtration, separation systems, specialty insertion valves, water disposal pumps, water supply pumps, fluid transfer pumps, turbine pumps, solid handling pumps, and agricultural spray nozzles. This segment provides products under Pentair Flow, Aurora, Berkeley, Codeline, Fairbanks-Nijhuis, Haffmans, Hydromatic, Hypro, Jung Pumpen, Myers, Sta-Rite, Shurflo, Südmo, and X-Flow brand names. The Water Solutions segment offers commercial and residential water treatment products and systems, such as pressure tanks, control valves, activated carbon products, commercial ice machines, conventional filtration products, and point-of-entry and point-of-use water treatment systems for use in water filtration and water softening solutions, as well as commercial water management and filtration solutions in foodservice operations; and installation and preventative services for water management solutions for commercial operators under the Pentair Water Sol","summary_zh":"Pentair plc 在美國、西歐、中國、拉丁美洲、中東、東南亞、澳洲和加拿大提供各種水解決方案。它透過三個部門運作：Flow、Water Solutions 和 Pool。 Flow部門設計、製造及銷售流體處理及泵浦產品及系統，包括壓力容器、氣體回收解決方案、薄膜生物反應器、廢水再利用系統及先進的薄膜過濾、分離系統、特種插入閥、污水處理泵浦、供水泵浦、流體輸送泵浦、渦輪泵浦、固體處理泵浦及農業噴嘴。該部門提供 Pentair Flow、Aurora、Berkeley、Codeline、Fairbanks-Nijhuis、Haffmans、Hydromatic、Hypro、Jung Pumpen、Myers、Sta-Rite、Shurflo、Südmo 和 X-Flow 品牌的產品。水解決方案部門提供商業和住宅水處理產品和系統，例如壓力罐、控制閥、活性碳產品、商用製冰機、傳統過濾產品以及用於水過濾和水軟化解決方案的入口點和使用點水處理系統，以及餐飲服務運營中的商業水管理和過濾解決方案；為濱特爾水解決方案下的商業運營商提供水管理解決方案","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"特種工業機械","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":106.1,"h":106.43,"l":105.26,"c":106.29,"v":1111100},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":106.15,"h":106.92,"l":105.46,"c":106.84,"v":934800},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":107.06,"h":110.09,"l":106.76,"c":110.06,"v":1245700},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":111.09,"h":111.8,"l":109.79,"c":110.64,"v":1118600},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":110.63,"h":110.97,"l":109.68,"c":110.68,"v":955600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":110.35,"h":110.63,"l":107.85,"c":109.13,"v":1062300},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":108.98,"h":110.58,"l":108.64,"c":109.26,"v":785000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":109.25,"h":112.91,"l":108.63,"c":112.59,"v":1106700},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":112.35,"h":112.52,"l":110.86,"c":110.95,"v":915200},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":110.95,"h":111.5,"l":110.31,"c":110.65,"v":899100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":110.62,"h":111.16,"l":109.65,"c":111.01,"v":1183400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":111.15,"h":112.34,"l":108.83,"c":109.46,"v":1628300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":110.1,"h":112.91,"l":109.93,"c":111.52,"v":1099700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":111.53,"h":112.25,"l":109.87,"c":110.3,"v":2172900},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":109.94,"h":110.56,"l":109.47,"c":110.09,"v":790400},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":110.64,"h":111.23,"l":109.46,"c":110.09,"v":834800},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":110.01,"h":110.09,"l":108.02,"