unt":1},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-24","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/77360/000007736026000007/pnr-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Unless the context otherwise indicates, references herein to \"Pentair,\" the \"Company,\" and such words as \"we,\" \"us,\" and \"our\" include Pentair plc and its consolidated subsidiaries.","zh":"除非上下文另有說明，本文中提及的「Pentair」、「本公司」以及「我們」、「我們的」和「我們的」等詞語包括 Pentair plc 及其合併子公司。"},{"en":"At Pentair, we help the world sustainably move, improve and enjoy water, life's most essential resource. From our residential and commercial water solutions to industrial water management and everything in between, Pentair is an S&P 500 company focused on smart, sustainable water solutions that help our planet and people thrive.","zh":"在濱特爾，我們幫助世界永續地移動、改善和享受水這生命最重要的資源。從住宅和商業用水解決方案到工業用水管理以及介於兩者之間的一切，Pentair 是一家標準普爾 500 強公司，專注於智慧、永續的水解決方案，幫助我們的地球和人類繁榮發展。"},{"en":"We are an Irish public limited company that was formed in 2014. We are the successor to Pentair Ltd., a Swiss corporation formed in 2012, and Pentair, Inc., a Minnesota corporation formed in 1966 and our wholly-owned subsidiary, under the Securities Exchange Act of 1934, as amended (the \"Exchange Act\"). Although our jurisdiction of organization is Ireland, we manage our affairs so that we are centrally managed and controlled in the United Kingdom (the \"U.K.\") and therefore have our tax residency in the U.K.","zh":"我們是一家成立於 2014 年的愛爾蘭上市有限公司。根據經修訂的 1934 年證券交易法（「交易法」），我們是 Pentair Ltd.（一家於 2012 年成立的瑞士公司）和 Pentair, Inc.（一家於 1966 年成立的明尼蘇達州公司，也是我們的全資子公司）的繼承者。雖然我們的組織管轄範圍是愛爾蘭，但我們管理我們的事務，以便我們在英國（「英國」）集中管理和控制，因此在英國擁有稅務居住權。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Flow customers include businesses engaged with end users, and wholesale and retail distribution in the residential, agricultural, commercial, food and beverage, and industrial vertical markets.","zh":"流量客戶包括與最終用戶從事業務的企業以及住宅、農業、商業、食品和飲料以及工業垂直市場的批發和零售分銷。"},{"en":"We have historically experienced increased demand following warm weather trends for residential water supply and agricultural products. Such demand historically has been at seasonal highs from April to August. Seasonal effects may vary from year to year and are impacted by weather patterns, particularly by temperatures, heavy flooding and droughts.","zh":"歷史上，隨著氣候變暖，我們對住宅供水和農產品的需求不斷增加。從歷史上看，這種需求在四月至八月期間一直處於季節性高點。季節性影響可能每年有所不同，並受到天氣模式的影響，特別是氣溫、嚴重洪水和乾旱。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Flow faces numerous domestic and international competitors, some of which have substantially greater resources directed to the vertical markets in which we compete. Competition focuses on brand names, product performance (including energy-efficient offerings and required specifications), quality, service and price. We compete by offering a wide variety of innovative and high-quality products, which we believe are competitively priced.","zh":"Flow 面臨著眾多的國內和國際競爭對手，其中一些競爭對手在我們競爭的垂直市場上擁有更多的資源。競爭的重點是品牌名稱、產品性能（包括節能產品和所需規格）、品質、服務和價格。我們透過提供各種創新和高品質的產品來競爭，我們相信這些產品的價格具有競爭力。"},{"en":"Effective January 1, 2026, we moved our residential and irrigation flow business from our Flow segment to our Water Solutions segment. As a result, the products previously within the residential and irrigation flow business are now part of the Water Solutions reportable segment. These products, including fluid transfer pumps, agricultural spray nozzles, as well as certain water disposal and water supply pumps, are used in various applications such as circulation and transfer, agricultural irrigation and crop spray. The residential and irrigation flow business includes brand names such as Berkeley, Hypro, Jung Pumpen, Sta-Rite and Shurflo. Given this change, the Flow segment will no longer serve wholesale and retail distribution customers in residential or agricultural markets. Additionally, the commercial and infrastructure flow and industrial solutions businesses have not historically b","zh":"自 2026 年 1 月 1 日起，我們將住宅和灌溉流量業務從流量部門轉移到水解決方案部門。因此，以前屬於住宅和灌溉流量業務的產品現在屬於水解決方案可報告部門的一部分。這些產品包括流體輸送泵、農用噴嘴以及某些水處理和供水泵，用於循環和輸送、農業灌溉和農作物噴灑等各種應用。住宅和灌溉流量業務包括 Berkeley、Hypro、Jung Pumpen、Sta-Rite 和 Shurflo 等品牌。鑑於此變化，Flow 部門將不再為住宅或農業市場的批發和零售分銷客戶提供服務。此外，商業和基礎設施流程以及工業解決方案業務歷來都沒有發展過。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Pool","val":1558800000,"zh":"水池"},{"name":"Flow","val":1553600000,"zh":"流動"},{"name":"Water Solutions","val":1062099999.9999999,"zh":"水解決方案"}],"total":4176000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":2938100000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Developing Countries","val":507800000,"zh":"開發中國家"},{"name":"Western Europe","val":496000000,"zh":"西歐"},{"name":"Other Developed Countries","val":234100000,"zh":"其他已開發國家"}],"total":4176000000}},"peers":["ROP","DOV","AOS","GWW","XYL"]}}